<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>SIOFOK, Hungary 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary beat Malta 3-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Zoltan Kovacs pen 47, Vilmos Sebok 57, Peter Lipcsei 90.</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
